  "title": "Chef John’s Drunken Noodles",
  "description": "Drunken noodles, also known as pad kee mao, is a popular Thai stir-fry dish with wide noodles, veggies, red chilies, and Thai basil in a delicious sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
