    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make drunken noodles, a Thai stir-fry dish that may have gotten its name from the fact that it's often enjoyed while slightly intoxicated. Chef John gives tips on how to properly prepare rice noodles and talks about the necessary ingredients, including shallots, scallions, garlic, Thai bird chilies, and Thai basil, as well as some optional meat and vegetables. He also explains how to make the not-so-secret sauce with oyster sauce, soy sauce, fish sauce, maple syrup, sugar, and water. Finally, Chef John demonstrates how to stir-fry everything together to make the delicious and filling dish.",
